{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":17,"ref":"1-chronicles 29:17","book":"1-chronicles","lang":"pcm","chapter":29,"translation":"And I know, my Elohim, sey you dey test ⟨את⟩ heart, and straightness you dey pleased with. I, for di straightness of my heart, I don volunteer all dis things; and now, your people wey ⟨dem⟩ show here, I don see with joy to volunteer to you.","tokens":[{"surface":"וידעתי","gloss":"and I know"},{"surface":"אלהי","gloss":"my Elohim"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"sey"},{"surface":"אתה","gloss":"you"},{"surface":"בחן","gloss":"dey test"},{"surface":"לבב","gloss":"heart"},{"surface":"ומישרים","gloss":"and straightness"},{"surface":"תרצה","gloss":"you dey pleased with"},{"surface":"אני","gloss":"I"},{"surface":"בישר","gloss":"for di straightness"},{"surface":"לבבי","gloss":"of my heart"},{"surface":"התנדבתי","gloss":"I don volunteer"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"all"},{"surface":"אלה","gloss":"dis things"},{"surface":"ועתה","gloss":"and now"},{"surface":"עמך","gloss":"your people"},{"surface":"הנמצאו","gloss":"wey show"},{"surface":"פה","gloss":"here"},{"surface":"ראיתי","gloss":"I don see"},{"surface":"בשמחה","gloss":"with joy"},{"surface":"להתנדב","gloss":"to volunteer"},{"surface":"לך","gloss":"to you"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-11T14:04:45.333907344Z","model":"glm-5.2"}